  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<p style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\">Dear all，<br />【六一】活动将于5月30日00:00:00-6月1日23:59:59上线，现申请相关上线配置。<br /><br /><br />辛苦&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(51,51,51);text-decoration: none;\">@叶导</span>&nbsp;审批，<br />辛苦&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(51,51,51);text-decoration: none;\">@灿灿</span> 配置。<br /><br /><br />具体需求如下（资源图钉钉提供）：<br /><strong><br /></strong></p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\"><strong>一、活动中心</strong><br />标题：六一<br />时间：5月30日00:00:00-6月2日23:59:59<br />色值：待补充<br /><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">位置：第一位，2日后移</span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\"><br /></p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\"><br /><strong>二、icon</strong><br />标题：六一（强挂）<br />文案：长大暂停，童年上线<br />时间：5月30日00:00:00-6月1日23:59:59<br />类型：普通，电台交友，视频交友<br />位置：第一位</p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\"><br /></p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\"><strong>三、首页banner</strong><br />时间：5月30日00:00:00-6月1日23:59:59<br />位置：第一位<br /><br /><strong>四、全站私信</strong><br />5月30日00:00:00<br />文案：【六一】<span style=\"\">长大暂停，童年上线。</span>完成5.30-5.31日游乐园任务得半屏座驾，即可在6月1日解锁全新玩法，敬请期待！</p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\"><br /></p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\"><span>6</span><span>月1日00</span><span>:00:00</span><span><br />文案：<span style=\"color: rgb(15,17,21);\">【六一】<span style=\"\">奔赴一场儿时旧梦。今日限定玩法已开启，集齐童年商品得限定童年勋章永久~</span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\"><br /></p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\"><strong>五、</strong><strong>开屏</strong><br />时间：5月30日00:00:00-6月1日23:59:59<br />位置：第一位</p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\"><br /></p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\"><strong>六、话题</strong><br />话题名称：『六一』<span style=\"\">长大暂停，童年上线</span><br />话题介绍：<span><span style=\"color: rgb(15,17,21);\"><span style=\"\">奔赴一场儿时旧梦</span></span></span>。完成5.30-5.31日游乐园任务得半屏座驾，即可在6月1日解锁<span><span style=\"color: rgb(15,17,21);\"><span style=\"\">限定童年勋章玩法~</span></span></span><br />时间：5月30日00:00:00-6月1日23:59:59</p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\"><br /></p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\"><strong>七、金刚区</strong><br />文案：六一<br />时间：5月30日00:00:00-6月1日23:59:59</p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\"><br /></p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\"><strong>九、礼物墙</strong></p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\">标题：六一<br />时间：5月30日00:00:00-6月1日23:59:59<br />礼物配置礼物墙banner</p><table class=\"relative-table\" style=\"width: 71.1762%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 8.21648%;\" /><col style=\"width: 12.8725%;\" /><col style=\"width: 5.29506%;\" /><col style=\"width: 5.29506%;\" /><col style=\"width: 39.6217%;\" /><col style=\"width: 5.75153%;\" /><col style=\"width: 22.8235%;\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td rowspan=\"10\">礼物墙礼物</td><td>礼物名称</td><td>价格</td><td>id</td><td>url</td><td>备注</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>童年放映机</td><td>6</td><td>24812</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3OTg3NDk2MzgwMyMgMTEjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3OTg3NDk2MzgwMyMgMTEjcG5n.png</a></td><td>新，幸</td><td>用户送给主播，主播获得1热力值，剩余参与童年放映机玩法，最高可获得23333热力值礼物。</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>等你下课</td><td>10</td><td>24813</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc1MTI2NjUzNTM1OCM5NjAjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc1MTI2NjUzNTM1OCM5NjAjcG5n.png</a></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>青空猫耳酱</td><td>99</td><td>24814</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc1MDkyMzM3MTE2MyMxNDUjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc1MDkyMzM3MTE2MyMxNDUjcG5n.png</a></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>甜漾秋千</td><td>520</td><td>24815</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3OTg3NDk5MzUyNCM2MzMjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3OTg3NDk5MzUyNCM2MzMjcG5n.png</a></td><td>新</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>夏日稚趣</td><td>1314</td><td>24816</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3OTg3NTAyNjM5OCM0ODIjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3OTg3NTAyNjM5OCM0ODIjcG5n.png</a></td><td>新</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>心跳时区</td><td>5200</td><td>24817</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc2NjU0NjM1NjI1NiMzMzcjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc2NjU0NjM1NjI1NiMzMzcjcG5n.png</a></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>荆棘诗篇</td><td>13140</td><td>24818</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc2OTA0ODQxNDg1MCMyMTUjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc2OTA0ODQxNDg1MCMyMTUjcG5n.png</a></td><td>高光</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>玫瑰骑士</td><td>52000</td><td>24819</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0NTU2MjQyMjMyNCM5MDQjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0NTU2MjQyMjMyNCM5MDQjcG5n.png</a></td><td>高光</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>山海棋局</td><td>99999</td><td>24820</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcwMzgzODc1OTc2MSMgNDYjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcwMzgzODc1OTc2MSMgNDYjcG5n.png</a></td><td>高光</td><td><br /></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\"><br /></p><p><span>气泡类型：默认<br />定位礼物：等你下课<br />生效场景：所有<br />生效人群：all<br />生效批次：首次<br />生效时间：5月30日00:00:00-6月1日23:59:59<br />优先级：1</span></p><p><br /></p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\">链接见下方<br /><br /><strong>链接如下：</strong></p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\"><strong>【六一】</strong>活动的<span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">线上链接</span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">icon数据链接：<a class=\"\" href=\"https://actapi.busi.inke.cn/api/act/act202605/tongqu_shiguang/icon\">https://actapi.busi.inke.cn/api/act/act202605/tongqu_shiguang/icon</a></span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\"><span>Banner: </span><a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202605/childhood-time/index.html?from=banner\"><span>https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202605/childhood-time/index.html?from=banner</span></a></p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\"><span>直播间icon: </span><a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202605/childhood-time/index.html?from=icon\"><span>https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202605/childhood-time/index.html?from=icon</span></a></p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\"><span>金刚区: </span><a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202605/childhood-time/index.html?from=kong\"><span>https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202605/childhood-time/index.html?from=kong</span></a></p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\"><span>活动中心: </span><a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202605/childhood-time/index.html?from=task\"><span>https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202605/childhood-time/index.html?from=task</span></a></p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\"><span>私信: </span><a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202605/childhood-time/index.html?from=msg\"><span>https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202605/childhood-time/index.html?from=msg</span></a></p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\"><span>闪屏: </span><a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202605/childhood-time/index.html?from=screen\"><span>https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202605/childhood-time/index.html?from=screen</span></a></p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\"><span>Push: </span><a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202605/childhood-time/index.html?from=push\"><span>https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202605/childhood-time/index.html?from=push</span></a></p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\"><span>首页弹窗: </span><a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202605/childhood-time/index.html?from=hallhot\"><span>https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202605/childhood-time/index.html?from=hallhot</span></a></p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\"><span>站外: </span><a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202605/childhood-time/index.html?from=other\"><span>https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202605/childhood-time/index.html?from=other</span></a></p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\"><span>房间消息: </span><a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202605/childhood-time/index.html?from=room_msg\"><span>https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202605/childhood-time/index.html?from=room_msg</span></a></p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\"><span>我的页选项: </span><a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202605/childhood-time/index.html?from=me\"><span>https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202605/childhood-time/index.html?from=me</span></a></